# Test: response_required_field_removed

## Old Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /users:
    get:
      operationId: getUser
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                required:
                  - id
                  - name
                properties:
                  id:
                    type: string
                  name:
                    type: string
```

## New Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /users:
    get:
      operationId: getUser
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                required:
                  - id
                properties:
                  id:
                    type: string
```

